1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 1=

10
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:03,660
(My name is Shen Li.)

11
00:01:04,190 --> 00:01:05,260
(My father, Shen Ji,)

12
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:06,710
(was Deputy Director
of the Imperial Medical Service.)

13
00:01:07,550 --> 00:01:08,830
(Grand Secretary Cui Hong)

14
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:10,720
(The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas)
(had long coveted)

15
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,470
(the Forbidden Qingnang Formulas.)
(my family's heirloom medical text,)

16
00:01:13,220 --> 00:01:13,590
Kill them.

17
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:14,630
(To seize the book,)

18
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:16,790
(he chose the night of the Ghost Festival
to slaughter the Shen Residence.)

19
00:01:17,310 --> 00:01:18,950
(It contains formulas
that can save lives,)

20
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,380
(but also weapons capable
of massacring an entire city.)

21
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:25,220
(But I was not destined to die.)

22
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:27,220
(My master pulled me back)

23
00:01:27,660 --> 00:01:29,300
(from the brink of death.)

24
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:30,900
(From then on,)

25
00:01:31,290 --> 00:01:32,770
(I followed him and learned
to identify countless herbs,)

26
00:01:33,150 --> 00:01:34,150
(recognize poisons,)

27
00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:37,980
(and master medicine that could
bring the dying back to life)

28
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:39,980
(or kill without leaving a trace.)

29
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,900
(He also taught me the art of strategy,)

30
00:01:43,540 --> 00:01:46,860
(to read people's hearts,
devise schemes, and unravel them.)

31
00:01:47,470 --> 00:01:50,430
(From then on, the young daughter
of the Shen family ceased to exist.)

32
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:54,500
(What remained was a cold blade
lurking in the shadows,)

33
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:56,620
(waiting to avenge my family
without drawing suspicion.)

34
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,620
(My master gave me a new name,)

35
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:00,470
(Gu Hanyi.)

36
00:02:00,470 --> 00:02:01,540
(Gu Hanyi)

37
00:02:04,110 --> 00:02:04,620
Master.

38
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:13,260
(Xie Yungui)
Drunken Haze.

39
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:14,620
You got the dosage just right.

40
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:16,830
It seems everything I taught you before,

41
00:02:17,750 --> 00:02:18,340
you still remember.

42
00:02:18,830 --> 00:02:19,700
I would never forget

43
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:20,890
what you taught me, Master.

44
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:22,030
Today,

45
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:23,110
I have another gift for you.

46
00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:29,980
There are three pills inside.

47
00:02:30,830 --> 00:02:32,670
They can save your life
when it matters most.

48
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:39,310
Thank you, Master.

49
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:43,140
Are you ready?

50
00:02:44,830 --> 00:02:45,260
Remember,

51
00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:47,140
the Capital is fraught with danger.

52
00:02:47,950 --> 00:02:49,180
Zhao Wujiu is a cunning old fox,

53
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:51,230
and Cui Hong
wields immense power at court.

54
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:53,620
Their spies are everywhere
in the Capital.

55
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:54,700
One wrong move,

56
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,390
and you'll plunge into the abyss.

57
00:02:56,980 --> 00:02:57,780
I understand.

58
00:02:58,510 --> 00:02:59,390
Only by staying alive

59
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:01,470
will I have a chance
to avenge my family.

60
00:03:02,110 --> 00:03:02,980
Today,

61
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:05,110
I'll introduce you to two allies.

62
00:03:05,470 --> 00:03:07,230
They will aid you
on your path of vengeance.

63
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:10,780
(Mei Qi)

64
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:12,700
Greetings, Miss Hanyi.

65
00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:15,300
I am Mei Jiu.

66
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:16,140
(Mei Jiu)

67
00:03:16,140 --> 00:03:17,190
It's a pleasure to meet you.

68
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,930
They were both illegitimate daughters
of official families.

69
00:03:20,350 --> 00:03:21,830
After being persecuted
by their fathers' principal wives,

70
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:22,999
they were forced
into the pleasure quarters.

71
00:03:23,350 --> 00:03:24,950
By chance, I was able to save them.

72
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:26,350
One refused to bend,

73
00:03:26,830 --> 00:03:28,580
and chose the arduous path
of martial arts.

74
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:30,190
The other

75
00:03:30,950 --> 00:03:31,980
saw through the ways of the human heart

76
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:33,700
and mastered the art of seduction.

77
00:03:34,790 --> 00:03:35,510
You two

78
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:36,830
are indeed quite extraordinary.

79
00:03:37,290 --> 00:03:38,400
The road through the Capital
is treacherous.

80
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,630
We'll need a sharp blade
to clear the way.

81
00:03:40,110 --> 00:03:40,790
I, Mei Qi,

82
00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:44,070
will protect you
at all costs, Miss Hanyi.

83
00:03:49,230 --> 00:03:50,260
The time has come.

84
00:03:50,580 --> 00:03:51,350
Our performance

85
00:03:52,350 --> 00:03:53,230
is about to begin.

86
00:03:53,980 --> 00:03:55,230
(Liu's Apothecary)

87
00:03:55,230 --> 00:03:56,420
(Under Master's arrangements,)

88
00:03:56,950 --> 00:03:58,830
(I began seeing patients
at Liu's Apothecary in the Capital.)

89
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:02,230
(More and more people came
seeking treatment after hearing of me.)

90
00:04:02,950 --> 00:04:05,070
(Some of them)

91
00:04:05,190 --> 00:04:07,670
(even suffered from rare illnesses
that official clinics could not cure.)

92
00:04:09,190 --> 00:04:10,300
I'll write two prescriptions for him.

93
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,390
All right. Thank you, Physician.

94
00:04:16,790 --> 00:04:18,110
Young Lady, we've arrived
at Liu's Apothecary.

95
00:04:18,110 --> 00:04:20,260
(Zheng Shu, daughter of Censor Zheng)

96
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:26,190
(Zheng Shu, legitimate daughter
of the Chief Censor.)

97
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:28,300
(She has long been frail and sickly.)

98
00:04:28,670 --> 00:04:31,230
(The Imperial Medical Service
declared her chronic illness incurable.)

99
00:04:32,350 --> 00:04:33,670
Your illness is not an epidemic.

100
00:04:34,950 --> 00:04:36,830
You unknowingly
consumed incompatible foods.

101
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:38,830
Combined with the distress
weighing on your heart,

102
00:04:38,980 --> 00:04:40,110
it caused excess internal heat,

103
00:04:40,470 --> 00:04:41,730
making your symptoms
resemble an epidemic.

104
00:04:42,830 --> 00:04:43,790
I'll treat you with acupuncture.

105
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,120
Then two doses
of medicine should be enough.

106
00:04:45,790 --> 00:04:46,830
Is that really true?

107
00:04:47,950 --> 00:04:48,460
Of course.

108
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:54,540
(Censor Zheng has always been at odds
with Grand Secretary Cui Hong.)

109
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:58,070
(If I can cure
his daughter's chronic illness,)

110
00:04:58,910 --> 00:05:01,740
(I'll surely
gain another powerful ally.)

111
00:05:02,300 --> 00:05:02,790
How do you feel?

112
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:05,950
I feel much better.

113
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,630
Divine Physician,

114
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:09,140
please accept my bow of gratitude.

115
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:11,240
I'm merely doing my duty as a physician.

116
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:15,020
(Imperial Medical Service)

117
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:16,220
Sirs, have you heard?

118
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:18,100
A remarkable physician named Gu

119
00:05:18,100 --> 00:05:19,780
has recently appeared in the Capital.

120
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:21,107
(Zhao Wujiu, Deputy Director)
And she's quite a beauty, too.

121
00:05:21,107 --> 00:05:22,160
(of the Imperial Medical Service)
And she's quite a beauty, too.

122
00:05:22,260 --> 00:05:23,870
She can even cure patients

123
00:05:23,870 --> 00:05:25,180
whom our Imperial Medical Service
had given up on.

124
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:28,430
She even cured
the Chief Censor's daughter

125
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:29,660
of her mysterious illness.

126
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:30,750
(Essential Prescriptions
Worth a Thousand Gold)

127
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:31,850
I've heard about that, too.

128
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:40,980
(Liu's Apothecary)

129
00:05:40,990 --> 00:05:42,100
All consultation numbers
have been given out.

130
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:43,750
Please line up here
to collect your medicine.

131
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:51,070
Thank you.

132
00:05:51,510 --> 00:05:51,900
Off you go.

133
00:05:53,140 --> 00:05:53,550
Next.

134
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:02,660
Remember to take
your medicine on time every day.

135
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:04,190
All right. Thank you, Physician.

136
00:06:13,780 --> 00:06:15,580
Zhao Wujiu, Deputy Director
of the Imperial Medical Service.

137
00:06:17,700 --> 00:06:18,100
Kill them.

138
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,140
Leave no one alive.

139
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:24,580
I've come
to pay Divine Physician Gu a visit.

140
00:06:27,630 --> 00:06:28,990
Lord Zhao, your presence

141
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:30,750
brings great honor to my humble abode.

142
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:32,960
(Benevolent Heart and Healing Arts)
Divine Physician Gu,

143
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,830
you're remarkably accomplished
for your age.

144
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:36,580
I hear

145
00:06:37,020 --> 00:06:37,750
you cured an epidemic

146
00:06:37,750 --> 00:06:39,990
that even the Imperial Medical Service
was powerless against,

147
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:42,390
and saved the Chief Censor's
daughter as well.

148
00:06:42,830 --> 00:06:43,990
You are quite capable.

149
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:45,900
I was merely fortunate.

150
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:47,510
I know only
a little of the healing arts.

151
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:50,990
May I ask who your master is?

152
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,950
And here in the Capital,

153
00:06:53,310 --> 00:06:54,660
do you have anyone to rely on?

154
00:06:55,070 --> 00:06:55,870
Lord Zhao,

155
00:06:56,750 --> 00:06:59,190
I am the daughter of the Gu family,
medicine merchants from Jiangnan.

156
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:01,220
My parents passed away,
and our family fell on hard times.

157
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:03,660
I have since come to the Capital to stay
with relatives in the medicine trade,

158
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:04,950
which is why I am
well versed in medicine.

159
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:10,700
I belong to no school or sect.

160
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:12,310
Practicing medicine here in the Capital,

161
00:07:12,750 --> 00:07:16,140
do you know
what you're getting yourself into?

162
00:07:16,750 --> 00:07:19,580
Why not let me
put in a good word for you?

163
00:07:19,950 --> 00:07:22,020
As long as you do as you're told.

164
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,100
What did you do to me?

165
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:31,310
Forgive me, Lord Zhao.

166
00:07:31,750 --> 00:07:33,100
I merely made your arm

167
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:34,100
temporarily unable to move.

168
00:07:34,310 --> 00:07:35,660
It will return to normal
within half an hour.

169
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:37,510
Do you know

170
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:39,750
the consequences of offending
the Imperial Medical Service?

171
00:07:40,750 --> 00:07:42,460
I was anxious
and acted without thinking.

172
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:44,830
I'm alone and far from home,
so I have no choice but to be cautious.

173
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:47,630
If you are willing,

174
00:07:48,220 --> 00:07:50,100
I would like to make amends.

175
00:07:57,310 --> 00:07:59,870
(She has no roots
or backing in the Capital.)

176
00:08:00,100 --> 00:08:01,220
(She'll be easy to control.)

177
00:08:01,900 --> 00:08:03,990
(Her medical skills
could also be useful to me.)

178
00:08:04,460 --> 00:08:05,630
(Excellent.)

179
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:11,260
At least you know what's good for you.

180
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:13,700
It would be a waste for your medical skills
to remain among the common folk.

181
00:08:13,990 --> 00:08:15,900
I can recommend you for a post
at the Imperial Medical Service

182
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:16,830
as a female medical attendant.

183
00:08:17,310 --> 00:08:19,430
From now on, you will follow my orders.

184
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:22,390
Thank you for your support, Sir.

185
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:25,260
I will obey your instructions.

186
00:08:26,510 --> 00:08:27,140
Good.

187
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:31,950
Report to the Imperial
Medical Service tomorrow.

188
00:08:32,590 --> 00:08:33,380
Thank you, Sir.

189
00:08:34,070 --> 00:08:34,950
Safe travels, Sir.

190
00:08:36,510 --> 00:08:39,430
(You want to treat me as a pawn
you can use and discard at will.)

191
00:08:40,510 --> 00:08:41,020
(Fine.)

192
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:44,310
(Then I'll let you watch this pawn)

193
00:08:44,310 --> 00:08:46,900
(move step by step toward
your most vulnerable spot.)

194
00:08:47,180 --> 00:08:49,540
(Imperial Medical Service)

195
00:09:04,950 --> 00:09:05,950
Divine Physician Gu.

196
00:09:06,260 --> 00:09:06,780
Lord Zhao.

197
00:09:08,140 --> 00:09:08,750
Everyone,

198
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:12,550
this is Divine Physician Gu, Gu Hanyi,
whose name has recently become known

199
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:13,700
throughout the Capital.

200
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:16,950
From now on, she will serve here.

201
00:09:18,580 --> 00:09:19,220
Medical Attendant Gu,

202
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:21,340
learn well from your seniors.

203
00:09:22,430 --> 00:09:25,070
I've heard Medical Attendant Gu
is highly skilled with golden needles.

204
00:09:25,950 --> 00:09:27,100
I only know the basics.

205
00:09:27,390 --> 00:09:28,950
I wouldn't dare
show off before my seniors.

206
00:09:29,950 --> 00:09:30,790
Carry on with your work.

207
00:09:31,380 --> 00:09:31,790
- Yes.
- Yes.

208
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:35,340
Then I'll show you around.

209
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:36,580
Thank you, Sir.

210
00:09:36,690 --> 00:09:37,250
This way, please.

211
00:09:47,950 --> 00:09:49,190
Zhao Wujiu has taken the bait.

212
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:51,500
I've finally set foot

213
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:52,620
inside the Imperial Medical Service.

214
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,190
The first move went smoothly.

215
00:09:55,740 --> 00:09:56,860
Now you must tread even more carefully.

216
00:09:57,860 --> 00:09:58,910
Zhao Wujiu

217
00:09:59,380 --> 00:09:59,980
will use you,

218
00:10:00,980 --> 00:10:02,150
but he won't trust you.

219
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:04,550
All the better.

220
00:10:05,030 --> 00:10:07,190
Then let his suspicions and schemes

221
00:10:07,910 --> 00:10:10,670
lead him straight
into the deadly trap we've laid.

222
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:17,220
(Zhao Wujiu's Daily Record)
Miss Hanyi, here's what you asked for.

223
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:19,340
A list of all Zhao Wujiu's
family members.

224
00:10:20,460 --> 00:10:22,860
(Zhao Wujiu is notorious
for his womanizing.)

225
00:10:23,270 --> 00:10:25,860
(His wife and concubines
are constantly at odds.)

226
00:10:26,550 --> 00:10:28,700
(When two sides clash,
a third stands to gain.)

227
00:10:28,910 --> 00:10:30,860
(Then let me treat you properly.)

228
00:10:50,010 --> 00:10:52,870
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

229
00:10:53,630 --> 00:10:56,570
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

230
00:10:57,230 --> 00:11:00,050
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

231
00:11:00,900 --> 00:11:03,890
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

232
00:11:04,740 --> 00:11:08,060
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

233
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:11,690
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

234
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:18,520
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

235
00:11:19,310 --> 00:11:26,400
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

236
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:36,750
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

237
00:11:37,050 --> 00:11:38,860
♪I stand here today♪

238
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:43,510
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

239
00:11:43,510 --> 00:11:51,000
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

240
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:52,930
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

241
00:11:52,930 --> 00:11:55,330
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

242
00:11:55,770 --> 00:12:02,620
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
